{"E:\\videos\\tswfilters\\wt\\vlog\\tswdrip\\voz\\b000_t2.wav": {"text": "No plug, no fan, no pump, no gas bottle, just a jug of old motor oil, a drip, and this. A stove made from two old truck wheels and a brake rotor roaring away in the corner of my garage, with a blue flame you can hear from across the room. People spend a fortune every winter heating a garage. Electric heaters that trip the breaker. Propane tanks that run out on the coldest night. and the whole time there is a jug of used oil sitting on the shelf from the last oil change holding more heat than a tank of propane. Today I build a drip stove that runs on nothing but gravity and old oil. Every part comes off a scrap pile, every measurement, every hole, step by step. Then we light it, set the drip and I show you how long one jug lasts and what it did to the temperature in here and stay for the drip plate.", "words": [{"w": " No", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.22}, {"w": " plug,", "s": 0.22, "e": 1.18}, {"w": " no", "s": 1.18, "e": 1.34}, {"w": " fan,", "s": 1.34, "e": 2.3}, {"w": " no", "s": 2.3, "e": 2.46}, {"w": " pump,", "s": 2.46, "e": 3.3}, {"w": " no", "s": 3.3, "e": 3.42}, {"w": " gas", "s": 3.42, "e": 3.82}, {"w": " bottle,", "s": 3.82, "e": 4.64}, {"w": " just", "s": 4.64, "e": 4.84}, {"w": " a", "s": 4.84, "e": 5.04}, {"w": " jug", "s": 5.04, "e": 5.3}, {"w": " of", "s": 5.3, "e": 5.5}, {"w": " old", "s": 5.5, "e": 5.78}, {"w": " motor", "s": 5.78, "e": 6.16}, {"w": " oil,", "s": 6.16, "e": 6.78}, {"w": " a", "s": 6.78, "e": 6.9}, {"w": " drip,", "s": 6.9, "e": 7.38}, {"w": " and", "s": 7.38, "e": 7.62}, {"w": " this.", "s": 7.62, "e": 8.02}, {"w": " A", "s": 8.52, "e": 8.62}, {"w": " stove", "s": 8.62, "e": 9.02}, {"w": " made", "s": 9.02, "e": 9.32}, {"w": " from", "s": 9.32, "e": 9.56}, {"w": " two", "s": 9.56, "e": 9.84}, {"w": " old", "s": 9.84, "e": 10.16}, {"w": " truck", "s": 10.16, "e": 10.5}, {"w": " wheels", "s": 10.5, "e": 10.82}, {"w": " and", "s": 10.82, "e": 11.28}, {"w": " a", "s": 11.28